@startuml Place Order Sequence Diagram

!theme plain
title Place Order Use Case\n(ביצוע הזמנה)

actor "User\n(משתמש)" as User
participant "Shipping Page\n(עמוד משלוח)" as ShippingPage
participant "Order Reducer\n(Redux)" as OrderReducer
participant "API Layer" as API
participant "Order Controller" as OrderController
participant "Customer Order Model\n(MongoDB)" as CustomerOrderModel
participant "Auth Order Model\n(MongoDB)" as AuthOrderModel
participant "Card Model\n(MongoDB)" as CardModel

User -> ShippingPage: Fill shipping information\n(מילוי פרטי משלוח)
activate ShippingPage

ShippingPage -> ShippingPage: Validate shipping form:\n- Name, Address\n- Phone, Email\n- City, Area\n(בדיקת תקינות טופס משלוח)

User -> ShippingPage: Click "Place Order" button\n(לחיצה על "בצע הזמנה")

ShippingPage -> ShippingPage: Prepare order data:\n- price (total amount)\n- products (cart items)\n- shipping_fee\n- shippingInfo\n- userId\n(הכנת נתוני הזמנה)

ShippingPage -> OrderReducer: dispatch(place_order(orderData))
activate OrderReducer

OrderReducer -> API: POST /api/order/place-order
activate API

API -> OrderController: place_order(req, res)
activate OrderController

OrderController -> OrderController: Validate required fields\n(בדיקת שדות חובה)

alt Missing required fields
    OrderController --> API: 400 - Missing required fields
    API --> OrderReducer: Error response
    OrderReducer --> ShippingPage: Show error message
    ShippingPage --> User: Display validation error\n(הצגת שגיאת תקינות)
else Valid order data
    OrderController -> OrderController: Process products:\n- Group by sellerId\n- Calculate seller totals\n- Prepare order structures\n(עיבוד מוצרים לפי מוכרים)
    
    OrderController -> OrderController: Generate order date\n(יצירת תאריך הזמנה)
    
    OrderController -> CustomerOrderModel: create(customerOrder)
    activate CustomerOrderModel
    note right of CustomerOrderModel
      Customer Order includes:
      - customerId
      - shippingInfo
      - products array
      - total price + shipping
      - payment_status: 'unpaid'
      - delivery_status: 'pending'
    end note
    CustomerOrderModel --> OrderController: Order created with orderId\n(הזמנה נוצרה עם מזהה)
    deactivate CustomerOrderModel
    
    OrderController -> OrderController: Prepare auth orders for each seller\n(הכנת הזמנות מורשות לכל מוכר)
    
    OrderController -> AuthOrderModel: insertMany(authorOrderData)
    activate AuthOrderModel
    note right of AuthOrderModel
      Auth Orders (one per seller):
      - orderId (reference to customer order)
      - sellerId
      - products (seller's products only)
      - price (seller's total)
      - payment_status: 'unpaid'
      - delivery_status: 'pending'
    end note
    AuthOrderModel --> OrderController: Seller orders created\n(הזמנות מוכרים נוצרו)
    deactivate AuthOrderModel
    
    OrderController -> CardModel: deleteMany({_id: {$in: cardIds}})
    activate CardModel
    CardModel --> OrderController: Cart items removed\n(פריטי עגלה הוסרו)
    deactivate CardModel
    
    OrderController -> OrderController: Set payment timeout (15 seconds)\nfor automatic cancellation\n(הגדרת זמן קצוב לתשלום)
    
    OrderController --> API: 200 - Order Placed Successfully + orderId
    deactivate OrderController
    
    API --> OrderReducer: Success response with orderId
    deactivate API
    
    OrderReducer -> OrderReducer: Update order state\n(עדכון מצב הזמנה)
    
    OrderReducer --> ShippingPage: Order placed successfully
    deactivate OrderReducer
    
    ShippingPage --> User: Redirect to payment page\nwith orderId\n(הפניה לעמוד תשלום)
end

deactivate ShippingPage

note right of OrderController
  Payment timeout mechanism:
  If payment is not completed within 15 seconds,
  the order status changes to 'cancelled'
  automatically.
  
  (מנגנון זמן קצוב לתשלום:
  אם התשלום לא מושלם תוך 15 שניות,
  סטטוס ההזמנה משתנה ל'מבוטל' אוטומטית)
end note

@enduml
